# fixedbugs, defect 2636, lane lane-include, 2026-11-21.
#
# A program holding by value the record of a fetched package's `pkgconfig`
# group, whose header the package does not ship: the library's, in the
# folder its `.pc` names, the route defect 2351's note gives a fetched
# package for a library's header. The package's unit and this program's
# each read that one file, so no file of the package's is stood in for and
# the build runs; until the repair the folder `pkg-config` names was refused
# `shadowed_header` as standing in for the package's own `fq2636.h`, which
# the package never had.
use <fq>/fq

function main()
    p: fq.Pair = fq.make(a: 3, b: 4)
    print(fq.scaled(p))
